=Create a complete social media package for one short vertical video.

ABOUT ME AND MY VOICE:
{{ $('Agent Config').first().json.brandVoice }}

TOPIC / IDEA:
{{ $json.topic || '(no description given; write general, honest captions that invite people to watch the video)' }}

EXTRA NOTES:
{{ $json.notes || 'none' }}

VIDEO:
{{ $json.videoSource === 'ai'
  ? 'An AI avatar of me will speak your video_script word for word, so write it to be spoken aloud naturally.'
  : 'I recorded this video myself. You cannot see it, so do NOT invent specific claims about what happens in it. Base the captions on the topic above. Still fill video_script with a 2-3 sentence summary.' }}

PUBLISHING TO: {{ $json.platforms.join(', ') }}

Write every piece in first person, as me. Adapt the length and style to each platform. Never use the phrases "In today's fast-paced world", "game-changer", "delve" or "unlock".

